of \"Toukyou\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She longs to see the outside world and has a slightly strong curiousity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with a bright, gentle and thoughtful personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her older brother and only family member has warned her severely to never go out of the city."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67438"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10b452b4a7d812c05a98f10a1484c084e7cfa0ad0357db51cfa76413fb458fe3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b82a3b78d4e9777d62d5310f4d75d5b4b343c845ecf60abf548d4c258a0c16e2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67439","characterName":"紫鳶＝クリノクロア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67439"},"originalCharacterName":"紫鳶＝クリノクロア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"106"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"The truth is I don't want you to go back, but that clock is bound to you and won't let go. To a horrible degree.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A resident outside of \"Toukyou\", he lives together with Ulen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has good manners and is the reliable older brother type who has a charming smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Compared to the self centered Ulen, he's quite a sensible man."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67439"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a42ea7fb67e5517b64573fcd1b6c528d08f9786969a98f416f7ec19b07df45d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/022815c7122d215cf14d53236a830a876577e3e219266b88db396bfcdb8f5511.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日野 聡","creatorId":"vndb:s82","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s82","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s82","name":"日野 聡","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:75360","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67440","characterName":"憂漣＝ミュラー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67440"},"originalCharacterName":"憂漣＝ミュラー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"807"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Love, yes, love. It is the concept that is the biggest hindrance in this world. I don't need it and I don't even want to understand it.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A resident outside of \"Toukyou\", an eccentric man who studies Toukyou's curse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has no interest in other people and of course no interest in love either."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has few friends due to his self-centered personality."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67440"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bddfc45a953f8d06e45c043ebdbdd72a45336102a5058b3c087627f0e37e2e37.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.